# Choicewise — Privacy Policy

## English

**Last updated: October 17, 2026**

Choicewise ("the app") is a decision-reflection tool published by vuqubey@gmail.com.

**Data we collect.** None. We do not collect, receive, store on our servers, share or sell any personal data. The app has no accounts, no advertising, no analytics and no tracking, and it does not connect to any server of ours.

**Data on your device.** What you type (decision descriptions, options, ratings), your recent decisions and your language choice are stored only in the app's private storage on your device so you can come back to them. This data is never uploaded. You can delete a saved decision inside the app; uninstalling the app or clearing its data removes everything.

**Permissions.** The app requests no device permissions.

**Children.** The app is not directed at children and does not knowingly collect information from anyone.

**Not professional advice.** Choicewise is a reflection tool. Its results are not legal, medical, financial or other professional advice.

**Changes.** If this policy changes, the updated version will be published at this address with a new date.

**Contact.** vuqubey@gmail.com

